This module is a focused TypeScript adaptation of the "aligned-weekdays" and
"default" layouts from NeatoCal (https://github.com/abetusk/neatocal), which is
itself a JavaScript port of Neatnik's Calendar (https://www.neatnik.net/calendar/).
Only the year-grid rendering, per-cell text and per-cell colors are adapted;
moon phases, ICS import and other NeatoCal features are intentionally omitted.
